$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Falda IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 5/9" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> A bloody rebellion has fractured the government on the planet of Falda IV.  Over the course of the rebellion two factions have risen to the occassion and defeated each of their rivals one by one.  Now only these two remain, and each is intent on putting an end to their only remaining adversary.  The military-minded Presidents of each of the factions have taken this opportunity to personally lead their forces in to battle.  The two armies will meet in a small rural community which has been abandoned-- yet another casualty of the war.  This community was always renowned for being a low security, 'open air' township and little cover exists to shield each President!  Attack fiercely and put your decoy to good use if you wish to prevail this day!\n\nProtect your President to your last breath and beyond while at the same time attempting to hunt down and kill the enemy President.  The first team to kill their enemy's President shall be declared the victor!";